Subject: [PATCH] Add tools/vps: deploy the matchmaker to a Linux VPS

deploy.sh builds a committed ref for linux-x64 (self-contained, throwaway
worktree) and installs it as systemd service exvs2-mm. Existing VPS
server.json is kept unless --force-config. Builtin STUN on UDP 3478/3479.
Local card servers point MatchUrl/StunHost at the VPS.

